{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261024/photo/bkn-20261024191157384-1024_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261024215138\"/><p>今晚(24日)攪珠的今年第114期六合彩，攪珠結果為9、25、26、28、44、45，特別號碼20。頭獎無人中；二獎4注中，每注派彩428,960港元；三獎88.5注中，每注派51,700港元。</p><p>下期六合彩將於周二(27日)晚上9時30分攪珠，估計頭獎基金達20,000,000港元。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T14:21:34.701640+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T11:11:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T15:38:15.775133+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T14:18:08.577181+00:00","content_hash":"71eed9c97d140e6a8b2a27d4fa5c26b34826241f8a837f6214f6794c329bc9c7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}